   "source": [
    "# SQuAD v2.0 — Extractive vs RAG Question Answering\n",
    "\n",
    "## Assignment Submission Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook contains the complete end-to-end implementation and evaluation of two QA systems on the Stanford Question Answering Dataset v2.0:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Pipeline A — Extractive QA** using `deepset/roberta-base-squad2`, with a custom Top-K span decoder and calibrated no-answer handling.\n",
    "- **Pipeline B — Retrieval-Augmented Generation** using a TF-IDF (and optional dense MiniLM) retriever feeding a `flan-t5-base` generator that is explicitly instructed to refuse when context is insufficient.\n",
    "\n",
    "Both pipelines are evaluated with **from-scratch implementations** of Recall@K, MRR and MAP, and generative outputs are scored on **Faithfulness** and **Answer Relevance** by an LLM-as-Judge."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup and Configuration"
